{"content": "Here are the primary causes of the 2008 financial crisis summarized in five bullet points:\n\n*   **Subprime Mortgage Lending**: Banks and lenders issued large numbers of mortgages to borrowers with poor credit histories (subprime borrowers), often with adjustable rates that would rise significantly after an initial low-rate period, increasing the risk of default.\n*   **Housing Bubble and Speculation**: Excessive demand for housing, fueled by easy credit and speculative investment, drove home prices to unsustainable levels, creating a bubble that eventually burst when prices began to fall.\n*   **Securitization and Complex Financial Products**: Lenders bundled these risky mortgages into complex financial instruments like Mortgage-Backed Securities (MBS) and Collateralized Debt Obligations (CDOs), which were", "reasoning": null, "logprobs": [{"token": "Here", "logprob": -0.09471615348306273, "top_logprobs": [{"token": "Here", "logprob": -0.09471615348306273}, {"token": "*", "logprob": -2.7750960210367737}, {"token": "The", "logprob": -3.911263547281891}, {"token": "-", "logprob": -5.96984966788736}, {"token": "While", "logprob": -6.060269437174469}, {"token": "It", "logprob": -7.391703687052399}, {"token": "1", "logprob": -7.750750623087555}, {"token": "\u2022", "logprob": -8.168879590372711}, {"token": "Based", "logprob": -8.466527066569}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -8.691700063089996}, {"token": "Please", "logprob": -9.466076932291656}, {"token": "Although", "logprob": -9.512909016947418}, {"token": "In", "logprob": -9.527360043863922}, {"token": "Note", "logprob": -9.608973584513336}, {"token": "There", "logprob": -9.722531400065094}, {"token": "I", "logprob": -9.759629330973297}, {"token": "To", "logprob": -9.773306928019196}, {"token": "Several", "logprob": -10.087187848429352}, {"token": "Five", "logprob": -10.560048184733063}, {"token": "<think>", "logprob": -10.563885770182281}]}, {"token": " are", "logprob": -0.03561226275093077, "top_logprobs"