{"content": "Here is a recipe for a **Simple & Hearty Vegetarian Chili**. This version is packed with flavor, uses common pantry staples, and comes together in about 30\u201340 minutes. It\u2019s naturally gluten-free and can easily be made vegan.\n\n### \ud83c\udf36\ufe0f Simple Vegetarian Chili\n**Prep time:** 15 minutes  \n**Cook time:** 25 minutes  \n**Serves:** 4\u20136\n\n#### Ingredients:\n- **2 tablespoons** olive oil or vegetable oil\n- **1 large** yellow onion, diced\n- **1 cup** bell pepper (any color), diced\n- **4 cloves** garlic, minced\n- **2 tablespoons** chili powder\n- **1 teaspoon** cumin\n- **1 teaspoon** smoked", "reasoning": null, "logprobs": [{"token": "Here", "logprob": -0.0007046874400131742, "top_logprobs": [{"token": "Here", "logprob": -0.0007046874400131742}, {"token": "Absolutely", "logprob": -8.030653875672435}, {"token": "#", "logprob": -8.579043310486888}, {"token": "<think>", "logprob": -10.447775762879466}, {"token": "This", "logprob": -10.451416891419505}, {"token": "Sure", "logprob": -10.696501653992748}, {"token": "Making", "logprob": -10.772768896424388}, {"token": "I", "logprob": -10.968649786316966}, {"token": "Hom", "logprob": -11.589728277527904}, {"token": "It", "logprob": -11.776930731141185}, {"token": "Certainly", "logprob": -12.113051336609935}, {"token": "Simple", "logprob": -12.215689581238841}, {"token": " Here", "logprob": -12.666220587098216}, {"token": "You", "logprob": -12.869566839539623}, {"token": "Ve", "logprob": -12.871878546082591}, {"token": "Of", "logprob": -13.170812528931712}, {"token": "###", "logprob": -13.271063726746654}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -13.32746402581892}, {"token": "Yes", "logprob": -13.3585385497447}, {"token": "Make", "logprob": -13.444775503480052}]}, {"token": " is", "logprob": -0.008169753730523865, "top_logprobs": [{"token": " is", "logprob": -0.008169753730523865}, {"token": "\u2019s", "logprob": -4.815304382026422}, {"token": "'s", "logprob": -10.982231719672907}, {"token": " ar