{"content": "The salt air bit at Elias\u2019s cheeks as he climbed the spiral stairs, his boots echoing against the cold stone. On the gallery, half-buried in wet sand, lay a bottle. It wasn\u2019t the usual green glass, but a deep, bruised purple, sealed with wax that smelled faintly of lavender and old smoke. He wiped the grime away, revealing a rolled parchment inside. His heart hammered against his ribs. For twenty years, the sea had given him nothing but silence and storms. Now, holding the fragile vessel, he felt the weight of a secret he hadn\u2019t known he was waiting for. He uncorked it, the scent of the past rushing out to meet the present.", "reasoning": null, "logprobs": [{"token": "The", "logprob": -0.23445103114487864, "top_logprobs": [{"token": "The", "logprob": -0.23445103114487864}, {"token": "E", "logprob": -1.69295475428941}, {"token": "El", "logprob": -4.281070446428082}, {"token": "Salt", "logprob": -5.758765911515972}, {"token": "Rain", "logprob": -6.090034222062847}, {"token": "Ell", "logprob": -6.725402569230816}, {"token": "M", "logprob": -7.126441692765972}, {"token": "Arthur", "logprob": -7.1879441494310115}, {"token": "Sil", "logprob": -7.610278820451519}, {"token": " Elias", "logprob": -8.238445019181988}, {"token": "Old", "logprob": -8.627017712053082}, {"token": "G", "logprob": -8.778965687211773}, {"token": "For", "logprob": -9.241752361711285}, {"token": "Ever", "logprob": -9.26436302607896}, {"token": "Ed", "logprob": -9.432744717057965}, {"token": "H", "logprob": -9.447931980546734}, {"token": "Har", "logprob": -9.453830456193707}, {"token": "Wind", "logprob": -9.544123386796734}, {"token": "Sal", "logprob": -9.714468693193218}, {"token": "Thomas", "logprob": -9.982297634538433}]}, {"token": " salt", "logprob": -0.5616092735847076, "top_logprobs": [{"token": " salt", "logprob": -0.5616092735847076}, {"token": " storm", "logprob": -2.3279972130378326}, {"token": " fog", "logprob": -2.4327240044196685}, {"token": " wind", "logprob":