{"content": "Imagine sunlight is like a big, mixed-up bag of all the colors of the rainbow. When that sunlight hits the air in our sky, it bumps into tiny, tiny particles of gas (like nitrogen and oxygen).\n\nHere\u2019s the magic trick: **Blue light is the smallest and most energetic color.** Because it\u2019s so small, it bounces around and scatters in *every* direction when it hits those air particles. It\u2019s like throwing a bunch of tiny blue marbles into a room\u2014they bounce off the walls and everywhere else.\n\nThe other colors (like red and orange) are bigger and heavier, so they mostly just keep going straight through the air without bouncing around as much.\n\nSo, when you look up at the sky, you\u2019re seeing all that **blue light bouncing", "reasoning": null, "logprobs": [{"token": "Imagine", "logprob": -0.8364572388460445, "top_logprobs": [{"token": "Imagine", "logprob": -0.8364572388460445}, {"token": "That", "logprob": -1.3558778626253414}, {"token": "Great", "logprob": -1.9770040375520992}, {"token": "Here", "logprob": -3.4025773865511226}, {"token": "Hey", "logprob": -3.5326433045198726}, {"token": "Have", "logprob": -3.71829699104331}, {"token": "Think", "logprob": -3.795670495681982}, {"token": "You", "logprob": -3.824490533523779}, {"token": "The", "logprob": -4.718256936722021}, {"token": "To", "logprob": -4.865689263992529}, {"token": "Hi", "logprob": -5.085978494339209}, {"token": "Actually", "logprob": -5.489237771682959}, {"token": "It", "logprob": -5.947136865310888}, {"token": "Okay", "logprob": -6.488760934524755}, {"token": "Well", "logprob": -7.103203759842138}, {"token": "Wow", "logprob": -7.155941949539404}, {"token": "Hello", "logprob": -7.334044442825537}, {"token": "Oh", "logprob": -7.437478051834326}, {"token": "Ever", "logprob": -7.797270761184912}, {"token": "Picture", "logprob": -7.970635400467138}]}, {"token": " sunlight", "logprob": -0.919041179082857, "top_logprobs": [{"token": " sunlight", "logprob": -0.91904117908285