{"content": "# Rust vs Go for Network Servers\n\n## Quick Summary\n\n| Aspect | Rust | Go |\n|--------|------|----|\n| **Performance** | Excellent, zero-cost abstractions | Very good, GC pauses possible |\n| **Memory Safety** | Compile-time guarantees | Runtime GC |\n| **Concurrency Model** | Ownership + async/await | Goroutines + channels |\n| **Learning Curve** | Steep | Gentle |\n| **Ecosystem** | Rich but fragmented | Simple, cohesive |\n| **Binary Size** | Small, static | Larger, but still static |\n| **Startup Time** | Fast | Fast |\n| **Error Handling** | Explicit (`Result`/`Option`) | Simple (`error` values) |\n\n---\n\n", "reasoning": null, "logprobs": [{"token": "#", "logprob": -0.3029975897624908, "top_logprobs": [{"token": "#", "logprob": -0.3029975897624908}, {"token": "Choosing", "logprob": -2.011013031657022}, {"token": "Both", "logprob": -2.887151718790811}, {"token": "Compar", "logprob": -3.434803009684366}, {"token": "When", "logprob": -3.510454178507608}, {"token": "R", "logprob": -5.469877243693155}, {"token": "Here", "logprob": -6.821460724528116}, {"token": "##", "logprob": -7.249761582072061}, {"token": "This", "logprob": -7.647241593058389}, {"token": "Writing", "logprob": -7.947620392496866}, {"token": "To", "logprob": -8.081701279337686}, {"token": "While", "logprob": -8.2574310309246}, {"token": "For", "logprob": -8.263143540079874}, {"token": "The", "logprob": -8.298421860392374}, {"token": "###", "logprob": -8.374946594889444}, {"token": "Building", "logprob": -8.622564316447061}, {"token": "Com", "logprob": -9.01424598758964}, {"token": " Choosing", "logprob": -9.14758110111503}, {"token": "I", "logprob": -9.391902924235147}, {"token": "Choose", "logprob": -9.608325958903116}]}, {"token": " Rust", "logprob": -0.007742096641777607, "top_logprobs": [{"token": " Rust", "logprob": -0.007742096641777607}, {"token": " Compar", "logprob": -4.911171128013848}, {"token": " Compare", "logprob": -9.365438629844903}, {"token": " Comparison", "logpr