{"content": "To find the average speed in meters per second (m/s), we need to convert the given distance and time into the appropriate units and then apply the speed formula.\n\n### Step 1: Identify the given values\n*   **Distance ($d$):** $180 \\text{ km}$\n*   **Time ($t$):** $2.5 \\text{ hours}$\n\n### Step 2: Convert units to meters and seconds\nThe standard unit for speed in this context is meters per second (m/s).\n\n1.  **Convert distance from kilometers to meters:**\n    $$1 \\text{ km} = 1,000 \\text{ meters}$$\n    $$d = 180 \\times 1,000 =", "reasoning": null, "logprobs": [{"token": "To", "logprob": -0.25681073119662656, "top_logprobs": [{"token": "To", "logprob": -0.25681073119662656}, {"token": "Here", "logprob": -1.7445235913040484}, {"token": "###", "logprob": -3.2651553814651813}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -5.356690949702486}, {"token": "Based", "logprob": -5.851312226557955}, {"token": "We", "logprob": -6.455316132807955}, {"token": "The", "logprob": -7.061082429194673}, {"token": "##", "logprob": -7.166728562617525}, {"token": "This", "logprob": -7.560716218257173}, {"token": "#", "logprob": -8.488219804072603}, {"token": "Given", "logprob": -8.842456406855806}, {"token": "It", "logprob": -9.0437150662186}, {"token": "First", "logprob": -9.058157510066255}, {"token": "here", "logprob": -9.065236634516939}, {"token": "Step", "logprob": -9.191801614070162}, {"token": "In", "logprob": -9.214826173091158}, {"token": "1", "logprob": -9.241705483699068}, {"token": "Ass", "logprob": -9.548142976069673}, {"token": "Since", "logprob": -9.636405534053072}, {"token": "Let", "logprob": -9.7891345684769}]}, {"token": " find", "logprob": -0.3022382983201979, "top_logprobs": [{"token": " find", "logprob": -0.3022382983201979}, {"token": " calculate", "logprob": -1.9896486529344557}, {"token": " solve", "logprob": -2.3675211199754713}, {"token": " determine", "logprob": -3.515695405864143}, {"token": " answer", "logprob": -8.930059266948128}, {"token": " convert