{"content": "1. **Maintain a consistent sleep schedule**: Going to bed and waking up at the same time every day helps regulate your body's internal clock, making it easier to fall asleep and wake up naturally.\n2. **Limit screen time before bed**: Reducing exposure to blue light from phones and computers prevents the suppression of melatonin, the hormone that signals to your body that it is time to sleep.\n3. **Keep your bedroom cool and dark**: A cool, dark environment mimics the natural conditions of nighttime, which promotes deeper, more restorative sleep by reducing distractions and maintaining optimal body temperature.", "reasoning": null, "logprobs": [{"token": "1", "logprob": -0.5137016518640714, "top_logprobs": [{"token": "1", "logprob": -0.5137016518640714}, {"token": "Here", "logprob": -0.9251339180994229}, {"token": "Maint", "logprob": -6.429354880623837}, {"token": "Establish", "logprob": -7.685553763680478}, {"token": "*", "logprob": -7.7749817116785245}, {"token": "Keep", "logprob": -7.8086426003503995}, {"token": "-", "logprob": -7.950297568612118}, {"token": "First", "logprob": -8.371003363900204}, {"token": "To", "logprob": -8.453429435067196}, {"token": "Create", "logprob": -8.7708008034754}, {"token": "Avoid", "logprob": -9.081341956429501}, {"token": "Tip", "logprob": -9.17528078394415}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -9.460089896492978}, {"token": "One", "logprob": -9.751551841073056}, {"token": "here", "logprob": -10.186038230233212}, {"token": "Try", "logprob": -10.211106513314267}, {"token": "Creating", "logprob": -10.262370322518368}, {"token": "Limit", "logprob": -10.385003302865048}, {"token": "###", "logprob": -10.489575599007626}, {"token": "I", "logprob": -10.508356307320614}]}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -2.448131067822601e-05, "top_logprobs": [{"token": ".", "logprob": -2.448131067822601e-05}, {"token": ")", "logprob": -11.469666166796518}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -12.863221807970834}, {"token": ".**", "logprob": -13.321696920885874}, {"