{"content": "In simple terms, **compound interest** is when you earn interest on your money, and then you also earn interest on that interest.\n\nThink of it like a snowball rolling down a hill:\n1.  **Simple Interest:** The snowball stays the same size, but you add a little more snow to it every day.\n2.  **Compound Interest:** The snowball gets bigger as it rolls. Because it\u2019s bigger, it picks up *more* snow each time it rolls. That extra snow then becomes part of the snowball, making it even bigger for the next roll.\n\n### A Simple Example:\nImagine you put **$100** in a bank account that earns **10% interest** per year.\n\n*   **Year 1", "reasoning": null, "logprobs": [{"token": "In", "logprob": -0.6166704801681959, "top_logprobs": [{"token": "In", "logprob": -0.6166704801681959}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -1.0162142423752272}, {"token": "Think", "logprob": -3.082572808659407}, {"token": "Compound", "logprob": -3.1658915189865553}, {"token": "To", "logprob": -5.973426690495344}, {"token": "###", "logprob": -6.522817483342024}, {"token": "Imagine", "logprob": -6.5946711210373365}, {"token": "Simply", "logprob": -6.860120644963118}, {"token": "The", "logprob": -6.961013665593001}, {"token": "Simple", "logprob": -7.276161065495344}, {"token": "Here", "logprob": -7.308969369328352}, {"token": "You", "logprob": -8.708953729069563}, {"token": "Comp", "logprob": -8.766757836735579}, {"token": "#", "logprob": -9.204980721867415}, {"token": "##", "logprob": -9.423743119633528}, {"token": "It", "logprob": -9.494966378605696}, {"token": "Thinking", "logprob": -9.545951714909407}, {"token": "Let", "logprob": -9.733648171818587}, {"token": "At", "logprob": -9.756307473576399}, {"token": "If", "logprob": -9.918317666447493}]}, {"token": " simple", "logprob": -0.005559418185658416, "top_logprobs": [{"token": " simple", "logprob": -0.005559418185658416}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -5.349565002902455}, {"token": " simplest", "logprob": -7.215518448337026}, {"token": " s