{"content": "**Introducing the Apex Pure: Your Daily Companion for Hydration**\n\nStay refreshed, anywhere, anytime. The **Apex Pure** stainless steel water bottle is engineered for those who value durability, style, and sustainability. Crafted from premium 18/8 food-grade stainless steel, it\u2019s built to withstand the rigors of daily life while keeping your water tasting crisp and pure.\n\n### Why You\u2019ll Love It:\n\n\ud83c\udf3f **Sustainable & Eco-Friendly**  \nSay goodbye to single-use plastics. The Apex Pure is designed to be reused thousands of times, helping you reduce your carbon footprint with every sip.\n\n\u2744\ufe0f **Advanced Insulation Technology**  \nDouble-wall vacuum insulation keeps your drinks **cold for up to 24 hours** and **hot", "reasoning": null, "logprobs": [{"token": "**", "logprob": -0.287023044813413, "top_logprobs": [{"token": "**", "logprob": -0.287023044813413}, {"token": "Here", "logprob": -1.7607760202772802}, {"token": "#", "logprob": -3.09910724281146}, {"token": "Int", "logprob": -4.774756885755796}, {"token": "###", "logprob": -4.9102988016493505}, {"token": "Meet", "logprob": -5.0129294168837255}, {"token": "Re", "logprob": -6.035781360853452}, {"token": "S", "logprob": -6.535092807997007}, {"token": "Discover", "logprob": -7.0058798563368505}, {"token": "E", "logprob": -7.198098636854429}, {"token": "Keep", "logprob": -7.4127402078993505}, {"token": "Title", "logprob": -7.941876865614194}, {"token": "Stay", "logprob": -8.079604603040952}, {"token": "Un", "logprob": -8.226823307264585}, {"token": "Hy", "logprob": -8.491689182508726}, {"token": "##", "logprob": -8.791253544080991}, {"token": "Rev", "logprob": -8.809159733045835}, {"token": "Experience", "logprob": -8.813140369642515}, {"token": "I", "logprob": -9.091495014417905}, {"token": "The", "logprob": -9.35175273536517}]}, {"token": "Int", "logprob": -1.0169698240137315, "top_logprobs": [{"token": "Int", "logprob": -1.0169698240137315}, {"token": "Re", "logprob": -