{"content": "Detective: \"You claim you were home alone, but the mud on your shoes matches the park\u2019s red clay perfectly.\"\nSuspect: \"I took a walk to clear my head; it\u2019s not exactly a crime scene, is it?\"\nDetective: \"It would be, if that walk ended right next to the victim\u2019s car.\"\nSuspect: \"I was just stretching my legs, Detective, not staging a murder.\"\nDetective: \"Then why does your watch show you stopped at 8:15 PM, exactly when the lights went out?\"\nSuspect: \"Maybe I was admiring the view, or maybe you\u2019re just looking for a reason to arrest me.\"", "reasoning": null, "logprobs": [{"token": "Detect", "logprob": -0.5002361144228544, "top_logprobs": [{"token": "Detect", "logprob": -0.5002361144228544}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -1.391181548993167}, {"token": "\"", "logprob": -2.322545608441409}, {"token": "\"You", "logprob": -4.237805923382815}, {"token": "\"The", "logprob": -5.05540235892969}, {"token": "\u201c", "logprob": -5.430802902142581}, {"token": "\"I", "logprob": -5.701871475140628}, {"token": "Det", "logprob": -6.235622009198245}, {"token": "The", "logprob": -6.286809524457034}, {"token": "\"It", "logprob": -6.914258560101565}, {"token": "\"So", "logprob": -6.967513641278323}, {"token": "\"We", "logprob": -7.1130691374941435}, {"token": "Sus", "logprob": -7.272729476849612}, {"token": "\"S", "logprob": -7.506072601239261}, {"token": "\u201cYou", "logprob": -7.597278198163089}, {"token": "*", "logprob": -7.603835662762698}, {"token": "\"Do", "logprob": -7.708892425458011}, {"token": " Detective", "logprob": -7.765027603070315}, {"token": "\"No", "logprob": -7.8558059539003935}, {"token": "\"What", "logprob": -7.880384048382815}]}, {"token": "ive", "logprob": -1.1496354815676568e-05, "top_logprobs": [{"token": "ive", "logprob": -1.1496354815676568e-05}, {"token": "ives", "logprob": -11.79844289283919}, {"token": "IVE", "logprob": -12.842527441789386}, {"token": "ore", "logprob": -14.545610480119464}, {"token": "ve", "log